{"version":1,"key":"card:526","content":{"id":526,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"297b91f8-af20-44a0-97dd-34bb0ad33814","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何写一张卡片？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"137d6817-c68c-45a9-bc42-9287c74c939c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之前遇到的问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8e43aa2a-0468-4461-91a2-052bc4f7fda7","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e4122608-abbd-4c97-a259-b6b67e5806f5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ea503d7-4fd8-47b5-922a-241e876365e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"追求完美主义，很难下笔"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d92f8a29-e072-4a3d-b053-8c9f66ec4671","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"933d2144-8785-4b42-94f3-c3bdbf1264ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"越写越发散，越写发现关联的东西越多，一张卡片加了很多知识点"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f1237a3-9d3f-4ccd-934b-8bea60001b8f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每一张卡片都是为了解决一个"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"问题"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"763fdcfe-f0c0-4773-92d4-29dfee40c7fd","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"118a882c-1b01-48de-b7c4-4068b3a8758f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e98db76-eb0a-4774-8b1f-93c0d918088d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为是一个问题，所以不是大而全，如果是大问题，那应该要拆解为多个小问题"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"141560a0-466b-4fc3-8996-96efc3df96b3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dec15307-86e1-4421-ad58-4d47f0ef061f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"限制了范围，产生的新的问题放在新的卡片，并且肯定和当前卡片有连接"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7a828d3b-9b17-42d0-9652-f6b3b2211ed7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入如何和卡片结合，把读到的书拆解为问题，在读的时候要一直产生问题，比如什么是xxx，为什么要xxx，怎么去xxx，每个问题都可以成为一张卡片。当然不仅仅是书，任何输入来源都可以使用这套方法，包括视频、博客、播客等等，把内容拆解为要回答的问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eccf6595-aabb-443f-970c-8692733e242f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然问题是从输入的内容来，但是答案不仅仅是来自于这里，这个时候就要自己主动使用各种渠道去回答问题，解决问题其实是很简单的，因为遇到的问题一般之前都有人遇到过，在互联网都可以搜索的到，特别是在当前 AI 的时代，AI 基本上都知道。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0d9224e7-4a9b-46e2-a499-f17a73c233e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那可能会问，既然都搜的到，还有必要记吗，写作有个最大的作用就是思考，写的过程会捋清楚体系结构，如果你不去写，这个思考过程就不会发生，这个过程是很痛苦、很耗时间的，但是如果你想清楚了，你会非常爽，进步就产生了，成长不是来自时间的积累，而是这些一个个的进步点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2f46abee-ae34-4357-aab4-322000fb128c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对输出也很有帮助，毕竟好记性不如烂笔头，持续的素材积累，等你输出想讲一个故事的时候，你会发现一切都准备好了。"}]}],"tags":["笔记系统"],"createTime":1740358341955,"updateTime":1761989591557,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1761989591557}}